invalid type: string "A: Open Library and choose a subject.\nQ: How do I check my performance?\nA: Open Dashboard.\nQ: How can I improve weak subjects?\nA: Review Improvement Areas in Dashboard and study recommended resources.\nGoal of LearnPro\nThe primary goal of LearnPro is to provide a complete AI-powered ecosystem for:\nLearning\nCareer Planning\nInterview Preparation\nSkill Assessment\nÿÿÿÿÿ